+// DADAO instruction info implementation. Includes the TableGen-generated
+// instruction info tables (DADAOGenInstrInfo.inc).  Custom overrides:
+//   copyPhysReg         - bank-aware register moves (LLVM-034t)
+//   expandPostRAPseudo  - i64 arithmetic / constant pseudos (LLVM-035t)
+//   analyzeBranch / removeBranch / insertBranch / getBranchDestBlock
+//                       - CFG branch support (LLVM-059t)
